        "edit": "Fix left-shift loop bounds: change `for (i = 2; i < 8; i = i + 1)` to `for (i = 0; i < 7; i = i + 1)` so all bits shift left (op[i+1] <= op[i]) and op[0] receives op[7], matching the expected op[1]@cycle9 value.",
